'''Shania''' is an [[NPC]] cow that is owned by {{NPCSprite|Farmer Rigby}}.  

== Quest ==
'''Shania''' is a part of the [[Quests#Quest: First Harvest|First Harvest]] quest. {{NPCSprite|Farmer Rigby}} asks the player to collect {{Item|Wheat|amount=10}} to feed their cow, '''Shania'''. Upon giving the {{Item|Wheat}}, the player will be rewarded with {{Green|+20}} {{Skl|Farming|XP}}.

